[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2940379593","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105450#issuecomment-2940379593","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105450","id":2940379593,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6vQqHJ","user":{"login":"dsnopek","id":191561,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTU2MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/191561?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek","html_url":"https://github.com/dsnopek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-04T15:00:56Z","updated_at":"2025-06-04T15:00:56Z","body":"So, is it `ResourceFormatSaverText` that's calling `ClassDB::class_get_default_property_value()` and leading to the unwanted noise?\r\n\r\nIf so, I think it'd probably be better to special case there (like you're already doing for `MissingResource`), than to special case in `ClassDB`","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2940379593/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3146587544","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105450#issuecomment-3146587544","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105450","id":3146587544,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc67jR2Y","user":{"login":"raulsntos","id":3903059,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5MDMwNTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3903059?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos","html_url":"https://github.com/raulsntos","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-02T16:09:40Z","updated_at":"2025-08-02T16:09:40Z","body":"> So, is it `ResourceFormatSaverText` that's calling `ClassDB::class_get_default_property_value()` and leading to the unwanted noise?\r\n\r\nFor Resources that's correct, here's the stack trace:\r\n\r\n```\r\nResourceFormatSaverTextInstance::save(String const&, Ref<Resource> const&, unsigned int) (/godot/scene/resources/resource_format_text.cpp:1937)\r\nResourceFormatSaverText::save(Ref<Resource> const&, String const&, unsigned int) (/godot/scene/resources/resource_format_text.cpp:2127)\r\nResourceSaver::save(Ref<Resource> const&, String const&, unsigned int) (/godot/core/io/resource_saver.cpp:128)\r\nCoreBind::ResourceSaver::save(Ref<Resource> const&, String const&, BitField<CoreBind::ResourceSaver::SaverFlags>) (/godot/core/core_bind.cpp:167)\r\n```\r\n\r\nBut for Nodes, it's `PackedScene::pack`:\r\n\r\n```\r\nPropertyUtils::get_property_default_value(Object const*, StringName const&, bool*, Vector<SceneState::PackState> const*, bool, Node const*, bool*) (/godot/scene/property_utils.cpp:178)\r\nSceneState::_parse_node(Node*, Node*, int, HashMap<StringName, int, HashMapHasherDefault, HashMapComparatorDefault<StringName>, DefaultTypedAllocator<HashMapElement<StringName, int>>>&, HashMap<Variant, int, VariantHasher, VariantComparator, DefaultTypedAllocator<HashMapElement<Variant, int>>>&, HashMap<Node*, int, HashMapHasherDefault, HashMapComparatorDefault<Node*>, DefaultTypedAllocator<HashMapElement<Node*, int>>>&, HashMap<Node*, int, HashMapHasherDefault, HashMapComparatorDefault<Node*>, DefaultTypedAllocator<HashMapElement<Node*, int>>>&) (/godot/scene/resources/packed_scene.cpp:907)\r\nSceneState::pack(Node*) (/godot/scene/resources/packed_scene.cpp:1268)\r\nPackedScene::pack(Node*) (/godot/scene/resources/packed_scene.cpp:2159)\r\n```\r\n\r\nAlthough, it looks like this PR now has conflicts after https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107355 was merged.\r\n\r\nNow that `ResourceFormatText` doesn't call `ClassDB::class_get_default_property_value()` directly either, I'll probably have to move the changes for `MissingResource` to `PropertyUtils` too.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3146587544/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3385666230","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105450#issuecomment-3385666230","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105450","id":3385666230,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7JzSq2","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-09T12:35:23Z","updated_at":"2025-10-09T12:35:23Z","body":"I wonder why it doesn't automatically fetch default values from base class. No other class inheriting Node/Resource have this problem.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3385666230/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3386123865","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105450#issuecomment-3386123865","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105450","id":3386123865,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7J1CZZ","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-09T14:22:21Z","updated_at":"2025-10-09T14:32:39Z","body":"Ok, I found it. MissingNode and MissingResource are registered as virtual classes. No idea what it means, but that makes ClassDB unable to get their default properties:\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/9a5d6d1049e589ce0cac08f65367a084b252c18b/core/object/class_db.cpp#L2248\r\nNot sure about the reason for this; maybe they are virtual only to make them not appear in Create Dialog. If that's the case, I'd just make them non-virtual and hard-code an exception to not show these types (unless there is a better way to make them hidden).\r\n\r\nEDIT:\r\nI guess that's the best way to hide a type:\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/9a5d6d1049e589ce0cac08f65367a084b252c18b/editor/gui/create_dialog.cpp#L857-L858","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3386123865/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3387637466","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105450#issuecomment-3387637466","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105450","id":3387637466,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7J6z7a","user":{"login":"raulsntos","id":3903059,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5MDMwNTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3903059?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos","html_url":"https://github.com/raulsntos","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-09T22:13:05Z","updated_at":"2025-10-09T22:13:05Z","body":"Looks like that works. I also hide `MissingResource` from the inspector's Resource selector, not sure if I'm missing any other places. Seems like a good use case for https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/90765.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3387637466/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3412016752","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105450#issuecomment-3412016752","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105450","id":3412016752,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7LXz5w","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-16T17:36:39Z","updated_at":"2025-10-16T17:36:39Z","body":"Based on my recent experiences with virtual classes, I think they are for things that should be managed outside the user's influence. For example GridMapEditorPlugin - it's exposed and you can use its methods, but it's something created by the editor and you shouldn't create another instance or mess with it outside the exposed API.\r\n\r\nMissingNode/Resource are a bit different. The editor may create them in your scene, meaning you can inspect them or serialize in the scene file. You are not supposed to create them manually though. It's harmless, but there is just no reason to do so.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3412016752/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3413958442","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105450#issuecomment-3413958442","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105450","id":3413958442,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7LfN8q","user":{"login":"raulsntos","id":3903059,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5MDMwNTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3903059?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos","html_url":"https://github.com/raulsntos","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-17T05:37:01Z","updated_at":"2025-10-17T05:37:01Z","body":"You could create them from scripts and extensions before. Maybe you are thinking of `GDREGISTER_ABSTRACT_CLASS`?","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3413958442/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3414498987","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105450#issuecomment-3414498987","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105450","id":3414498987,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7LhR6r","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-17T08:52:44Z","updated_at":"2025-10-17T08:52:44Z","body":"You're right, seems like I was under a false assumption with this one. This comes as a bit of a surprise to me, because that means we're making the same suboptimal trade off with all virtual classes — they aren't protected from being instantiated anyway, yet we're avoiding instantiating them for default value purposes.\r\nSo I guess 'virtual' means \"Don't instantiate - unless you know what you're doing\"? That seems like a pretty unusual property to have in a type system.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3414498987/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3415039328","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105450#issuecomment-3415039328","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105450","id":3415039328,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7LjV1g","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-17T11:10:54Z","updated_at":"2025-10-17T11:10:54Z","body":"I think that might be not intended?\r\nTo me the difference between abstract and virtual is that abstract are supposed to be inherited and not instantiated (so like regular abstract classes), while virtual are stand-alone, i.e. not inherited, and you are not supposed to instantiate them, but an instance may exist created by the editor or whatever.\r\nBut I don't know if that's really what they are supposed to be, it's not the first time this concept causes confusion.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3415039328/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3424065029","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105450#issuecomment-3424065029","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105450","id":3424065029,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7MFxYF","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-20T23:15:57Z","updated_at":"2025-10-20T23:15:57Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3424065029/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]